{"code":0,"message":"success","value":{"docId":"0bca8940213c4232b99c14eb99b24e8a","title":"点对点消息","lang":"cn","domain":"10100000","businessName":"HMS Core > Smart Devices","businessType":"10101014","businessTypeName":"穿戴能力","serviceType":"5734b590f11f4e839a20a8642c1a1a29","version":"V22","anchorList":[{"anchorId":"section145793422598","level":"1","title":"导入模块","apiAtomic":0},{"anchorId":"section235119350911","level":"1","title":"P2pClient.setPeerPkgName(string)","apiAtomic":0},{"anchorId":"section115961235115919","level":"1","title":"P2pClient.setPeerFingerPrint(string)","apiAtomic":0},{"anchorId":"section4682131185915","level":"1","title":"P2pClient.ping(Object)","apiAtomic":0},{"anchorId":"section1450618291164","level":"1","title":"P2pClient.send(Object)","apiAtomic":0},{"anchorId":"section2682846161612","level":"1","title":"P2pClient.registerReceiver(Object)","apiAtomic":0},{"anchorId":"section1672614593166","level":"1","title":"P2pClient.unregisterReceiver(Object)","apiAtomic":0}],"status":"4","content":{"content":"<html><head></head><body><a name=\"ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001919950497\"></a><a name=\"ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001919950497\"></a>  <h1>点对点消息</h1> <div id=\"body57419169\"><div class=\"section\" id=\"section145793422598\"><a name=\"section145793422598\"></a><a name=\"section145793422598\"></a><h4>导入模块</h4><pre class=\"screen\" id=\"ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001919950497__screen622513557127\">import { P2pClient, Message, Builder } from '../wearengine'</pre> </div> <div class=\"section\" id=\"section235119350911\"><a name=\"section235119350911\"></a><a name=\"section235119350911\"></a><h4>P2pClient.setPeerPkgName(string)</h4><p id=\"ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001919950497__p635153516917\">设置手机侧应用包名。</p> <ul id=\"ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001919950497__ul135193514916\"><li id=\"ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001919950497__li16351635892\">请求参数 <div class=\"tablenoborder\"><table id=\"ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001919950497__table335143512919\"><caption><b>表1 </b>请求参数</caption><thead><tr id=\"ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001919950497__row5352835598\"><th align=\"left\" class=\"cellrowborder\" id=\"mcps1.3.2.3.1.1.2.5.1.1\" valign=\"top\" width=\"25%\"><p id=\"ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001919950497__p335253519912\">参数</p> </th> <th align=\"left\" class=\"cellrowborder\" id=\"mcps1.3.2.3.1.1.2.5.1.2\" valign=\"top\" width=\"25%\"><p id=\"ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001919950497__p113521352915\">类型</p> </th> <th align=\"left\" class=\"cellrowborder\" id=\"mcps1.3.2.3.1.1.2.5.1.3\" valign=\"top\" width=\"9.33%\"><p id=\"ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001919950497__p9352135391\">必填</p> </th> <th align=\"left\" class=\"cellrowborder\" id=\"mcps1.3.2.3.1.1.2.5.1.4\" valign=\"top\" width=\"40.67%\"><p id=\"ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001919950497__p335203517911\">说明</p> </th> </tr> </thead> <tbody><tr id=\"ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001919950497__row23521735896\"><td class=\"cellrowborder\" valign=\"top\" width=\"25%\"><p id=\"ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001919950497__p8352235699\">peerPkgName</p> </td> <td class=\"cellrowborder\" valign=\"top\" width=\"25%\"><p id=\"ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001919950497__p193527351993\">string</p> </td> <td class=\"cellrowborder\" valign=\"top\" width=\"9.33%\"><p id=\"ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001919950497__p123521351996\">是</p> </td> <td class=\"cellrowborder\" valign=\"top\" width=\"40.67%\"><p id=\"ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001919950497__p1335212351595\">手机侧应用包名，区分大小写。</p> </td> </tr>  </tbody></table> </div> </li><li id=\"ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001919950497__li143545359915\">示例代码<pre class=\"screen\" id=\"ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001919950497__screen5303163916113\">// 创建点对点通信对象\nvar p2pClient = new P2pClient();\nvar peerPkgName = \"com.*.*\";\n\n// 设置需要通信的手机侧对应的应用包名\np2pClient.setPeerPkgName(peerPkgName);</pre> </li></ul> </div> <div class=\"section\" id=\"section115961235115919\"><a name=\"section115961235115919\"></a><a name=\"section115961235115919\"></a><h4>P2pClient.setPeerFingerPrint(string)</h4><p id=\"ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001919950497__p859614352595\">设置手机侧应用指纹信息。</p> <div class=\"note\" id=\"ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001919950497__note0410259194915\"><img originheight=\"38\" originwidth=\"102\" src=\"https://communityfile-drcn.op.dbankcloud.cn/FileServer/getFile/cmtyPub/011/111/111/0000000000011111111.20240702155028.07111762388002992488088458939274:50001231000000:2800:7FE39B15188CFFB710F61017CC46796D8A6B3E630568704D65ACC98C7DA17BEA.png?needInitFileName=true?needInitFileName=true\"><span class=\"notetitle\"> </span><div class=\"notebody\"><div class=\"p\" id=\"ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001919950497__p34101596491\">轻量级智能穿戴设备系统 10.1.3.28以下版本不支持调用<a href=\"https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/connectivity-References/point-to-point-message-0000001052164296#section115961235115919\">setPeerFingerPrint</a>方法，请使用config.json配置方式获取手机侧应用指纹信息。<pre class=\"screen\" id=\"ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001919950497__screen9733833144917\">// 在工程的config.json文件的module模块中配置手机侧应用指纹信息metaData。\n\"metaData\": {\n  \"customizeData\": [\n    {\n      \"name\": \"supportLists\",\n      // 由包名和指纹信息组成，最长支持255\n      \"value\": \"com.huawei.idehelper:69178F8F5B8DF***\"\n      \"extra\": \"\"\n    }\n  ]\n}</pre> </div> </div></div> <ul id=\"ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001919950497__ul359623512592\"><li id=\"ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001919950497__li15962352596\">请求参数 <div class=\"tablenoborder\"><table id=\"ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001919950497__table959643516593\"><caption><b>表2 </b>请求参数</caption><thead><tr id=\"ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001919950497__row9597133518594\"><th align=\"left\" class=\"cellrowborder\" id=\"mcps1.3.3.4.1.1.2.5.1.1\" valign=\"top\" width=\"25%\"><p id=\"ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001919950497__p10597435195912\">参数</p> </th> <th align=\"left\" class=\"cellrowborder\" id=\"mcps1.3.3.4.1.1.2.5.1.2\" valign=\"top\" width=\"25%\"><p id=\"ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001919950497__p175971635115915\">类型</p> </th> <th align=\"left\" class=\"cellrowborder\" id=\"mcps1.3.3.4.1.1.2.5.1.3\" valign=\"top\" width=\"9.33%\"><p id=\"ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001919950497__p17597193565913\">必填</p> </th> <th align=\"left\" class=\"cellrowborder\" id=\"mcps1.3.3.4.1.1.2.5.1.4\" valign=\"top\" width=\"40.67%\"><p id=\"ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001919950497__p1559763514592\">说明</p> </th> </tr> </thead> <tbody><tr id=\"ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001919950497__row1559793513592\"><td class=\"cellrowborder\" valign=\"top\" width=\"25%\"><p id=\"ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001919950497__p19597173535916\">fingerPrint</p> </td> <td class=\"cellrowborder\" valign=\"top\" width=\"25%\"><p id=\"ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001919950497__p155971535175914\">string</p> </td> <td class=\"cellrowborder\" valign=\"top\" width=\"9.33%\"><p id=\"ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001919950497__p1359703515596\">是</p> </td> <td class=\"cellrowborder\" valign=\"top\" width=\"40.67%\"><p id=\"ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001919950497__p1159720356597\">手机侧应用指纹信息。</p> </td> </tr>  </tbody></table> </div> </li><li id=\"ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001919950497__li195971435195913\">示例代码<pre class=\"screen\" id=\"ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001919950497__screen459753555914\">// 创建点对点通信对象\nvar p2pClient = new P2pClient();\nvar peerFinger = \"67DFB7FD********\";\n\n// 设置需要通信的手机侧对应的应用包名\np2pClient.setPeerPkgName(peerPkgName);\n\n// 设置需要通信的手机侧对应的应用指纹信息\np2pClient.setPeerFingerPrint(peerFinger);</pre> </li></ul> </div> <div class=\"section\" id=\"section4682131185915\"><a name=\"section4682131185915\"></a><a name=\"section4682131185915\"></a><h4>P2pClient.ping(Object)</h4><p id=\"ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001919950497__p754194081813\">检测手机侧是否已安装指定应用，若手机侧应用未安装，则返回错误码204，若已安装返回205。</p> <ul id=\"ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001919950497__ul155494081817\"><li id=\"ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001919950497__li17541540181815\">请求参数 <div class=\"tablenoborder\"><table id=\"ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001919950497__table175412408188\"><caption><b>表3 </b>请求参数</caption><thead><tr id=\"ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001919950497__row654204031816\"><th align=\"left\" class=\"cellrowborder\" id=\"mcps1.3.4.3.1.1.2.5.1.1\" valign=\"top\" width=\"25%\"><p id=\"ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001919950497__p954194014183\">参数</p> </th> <th align=\"left\" class=\"cellrowborder\" id=\"mcps1.3.4.3.1.1.2.5.1.2\" valign=\"top\" width=\"25%\"><p id=\"ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001919950497__p554140181814\">类型</p> </th> <th align=\"left\" class=\"cellrowborder\" id=\"mcps1.3.4.3.1.1.2.5.1.3\" valign=\"top\" width=\"9.33%\"><p id=\"ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001919950497__p654440171815\">必填</p> </th> <th align=\"left\" class=\"cellrowborder\" id=\"mcps1.3.4.3.1.1.2.5.1.4\" valign=\"top\" width=\"40.67%\"><p id=\"ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001919950497__p1055840181819\">说明</p> </th> </tr> </thead> <tbody><tr id=\"ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001919950497__row205512403187\"><td class=\"cellrowborder\" valign=\"top\" width=\"25%\"><p id=\"ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001919950497__p25544071814\"><a href=\"#ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001919950497__table7255189161915\">pingCallback</a></p> </td> <td class=\"cellrowborder\" valign=\"top\" width=\"25%\"><p id=\"ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001919950497__p185515405187\">Object</p> </td> <td class=\"cellrowborder\" valign=\"top\" width=\"9.33%\"><p id=\"ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001919950497__p145594011180\">是</p> </td> <td class=\"cellrowborder\" valign=\"top\" width=\"40.67%\"><p id=\"ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001919950497__p1055840131814\">ping消息回调。</p> </td> </tr>  </tbody></table> </div> <ul id=\"ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001919950497__ul416716539348\"><li id=\"ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001919950497__li14167953113416\">pingCallback <div class=\"tablenoborder\"><a name=\"ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001919950497__table7255189161915\"></a><a name=\"table7255189161915\"></a><table id=\"ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001919950497__table7255189161915\"><thead><tr id=\"ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001919950497__row18256179191911\"><th align=\"left\" class=\"cellrowborder\" id=\"mcps1.3.4.3.1.2.1.1.1.5.1.1\" valign=\"top\" width=\"25%\"><p id=\"ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001919950497__p791271617194\">参数</p> </th> <th align=\"left\" class=\"cellrowborder\" id=\"mcps1.3.4.3.1.2.1.1.1.5.1.2\" valign=\"top\" width=\"25%\"><p id=\"ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001919950497__p1891241611198\">类型</p> </th> <th align=\"left\" class=\"cellrowborder\" id=\"mcps1.3.4.3.1.2.1.1.1.5.1.3\" valign=\"top\" width=\"9.6%\"><p id=\"ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001919950497__p091221616195\">必填</p> </th> <th align=\"left\" class=\"cellrowborder\" id=\"mcps1.3.4.3.1.2.1.1.1.5.1.4\" valign=\"top\" width=\"40.400000000000006%\"><p id=\"ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001919950497__p4912121614198\">说明</p> </th> </tr> </thead> <tbody><tr id=\"ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001919950497__row152562097196\"><td class=\"cellrowborder\" valign=\"top\" width=\"25%\"><p id=\"ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001919950497__p0913171612198\">onSuccess</p> </td> <td class=\"cellrowborder\" valign=\"top\" width=\"25%\"><p id=\"ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001919950497__p5913201610194\">Function</p> </td> <td class=\"cellrowborder\" valign=\"top\" width=\"9.6%\"><p id=\"ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001919950497__p19913181617198\">是</p> </td> <td class=\"cellrowborder\" valign=\"top\" width=\"40.400000000000006%\"><p id=\"ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001919950497__p139131316101918\">接口调用成功的回调函数。</p> </td> </tr> <tr id=\"ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001919950497__row325649181918\"><td class=\"cellrowborder\" valign=\"top\" width=\"25%\"><p id=\"ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001919950497__p1491371611915\">onFailure</p> </td> <td class=\"cellrowborder\" valign=\"top\" width=\"25%\"><p id=\"ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001919950497__p129131516161918\">Function</p> </td> <td class=\"cellrowborder\" valign=\"top\" width=\"9.6%\"><p id=\"ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001919950497__p491331671912\">是</p> </td> <td class=\"cellrowborder\" valign=\"top\" width=\"40.400000000000006%\"><p id=\"ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001919950497__p159139163198\">接口调用失败的回调函数。</p> </td> </tr> <tr id=\"ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001919950497__row42561792193\"><td class=\"cellrowborder\" valign=\"top\" width=\"25%\"><p id=\"ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001919950497__p791313168194\">onPingResult</p> </td> <td class=\"cellrowborder\" valign=\"top\" width=\"25%\"><p id=\"ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001919950497__p491351614199\">Function</p> </td> <td class=\"cellrowborder\" valign=\"top\" width=\"9.6%\"><p id=\"ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001919950497__p3913216111913\">是</p> </td> <td class=\"cellrowborder\" valign=\"top\" width=\"40.400000000000006%\"><p id=\"ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001919950497__p291301621917\">接口调用结果回调函数。</p> </td> </tr>  </tbody></table> </div> </li></ul> </li><li id=\"ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001919950497__li1756340131814\">示例代码<pre class=\"screen\" id=\"ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001919950497__screen1156040161811\">// 创建点对点通信对象\nvar p2pClient = new P2pClient();\nvar peerPkgName = \"com.*.*\";\n\n// 设置需要通信的手机侧对应的应用包名\np2pClient.setPeerPkgName(peerPkgName);\n\n// 检测手机侧对应的应用是否安装\np2pClient.ping({\n  onSuccess: function() {\n    console.log('ping success.');\n  },\n  onFailure: function() {\n    console.log('ping failed');\n  },\n  onPingResult: <span style=\"color: rgb(0,0,255);\">function</span>(resultCode) {\n    console.log(resultCode.data + resultCode.code);\n  },\n});</pre> </li></ul> </div> <div class=\"section\" id=\"section1450618291164\"><a name=\"section1450618291164\"></a><a name=\"section1450618291164\"></a><h4>P2pClient.send(Object)</h4><p id=\"ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001919950497__p51831824142012\">向手机侧发送消息及文件。</p> <ul id=\"ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001919950497__ul111837242205\"><li id=\"ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001919950497__li11832247209\">请求参数 <div class=\"tablenoborder\"><table id=\"ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001919950497__table618317249203\"><caption><b>表4 </b>请求参数</caption><thead><tr id=\"ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001919950497__row8183524132013\"><th align=\"left\" class=\"cellrowborder\" id=\"mcps1.3.5.3.1.1.2.5.1.1\" valign=\"top\" width=\"25%\"><p id=\"ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001919950497__p6183112412013\">参数</p> </th> <th align=\"left\" class=\"cellrowborder\" id=\"mcps1.3.5.3.1.1.2.5.1.2\" valign=\"top\" width=\"25%\"><p id=\"ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001919950497__p1218382492020\">类型</p> </th> <th align=\"left\" class=\"cellrowborder\" id=\"mcps1.3.5.3.1.1.2.5.1.3\" valign=\"top\" width=\"9.33%\"><p id=\"ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001919950497__p0183102472018\">必填</p> </th> <th align=\"left\" class=\"cellrowborder\" id=\"mcps1.3.5.3.1.1.2.5.1.4\" valign=\"top\" width=\"40.67%\"><p id=\"ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001919950497__p31831624192019\">说明</p> </th> </tr> </thead> <tbody><tr id=\"ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001919950497__row318382482018\"><td class=\"cellrowborder\" valign=\"top\" width=\"25%\"><p id=\"ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001919950497__p5508318