.png\"</p> <div class=\"note\" id=\"ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001919950497__note928610451162\"><span class=\"notetitle\"> 说明： </span><div class=\"notebody\"><p id=\"ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001919950497__p1828613451865\">若发送失败且错误码为208，则说明穿戴设备版本过低，提示用户进行版本升级。</p> </div></div> </td> </tr> <tr id=\"ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001919950497__row7714481416\"><td class=\"cellrowborder\" valign=\"top\" width=\"25%\"><p id=\"ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001919950497__p1976415271823\">mode</p> </td> <td class=\"cellrowborder\" valign=\"top\" width=\"25%\"><p id=\"ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001919950497__p7794813114\">string</p> </td> <td class=\"cellrowborder\" valign=\"top\" width=\"9.2%\"><p id=\"ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001919950497__p147148615\">否</p> </td> <td class=\"cellrowborder\" valign=\"top\" width=\"40.8%\"><p id=\"ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001919950497__p162241545627\">文件类型。可选值为\"text\",\"binary\"。</p> </td> </tr> <tr id=\"ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001919950497__row115111251318\"><td class=\"cellrowborder\" valign=\"top\" width=\"25%\"><p id=\"ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001919950497__p1480515301225\">mode2</p> </td> <td class=\"cellrowborder\" valign=\"top\" width=\"25%\"><p id=\"ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001919950497__p1551116518116\">string</p> </td> <td class=\"cellrowborder\" valign=\"top\" width=\"9.2%\"><p id=\"ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001919950497__p1451116511414\">否</p> </td> <td class=\"cellrowborder\" valign=\"top\" width=\"40.8%\"><p id=\"ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001919950497__p291610191331\">文件属性。可选值为\"R\",\"W\",\"RW\"。</p> </td> </tr>  </tbody></table> </div> </li></ul> </li></ul> </li><li id=\"ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001919950497__li1381115102398\">sendCallback <div class=\"tablenoborder\"><a name=\"ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001919950497__table9932347151817\"></a><a name=\"table9932347151817\"></a><table id=\"ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001919950497__table9932347151817\"><thead><tr id=\"ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001919950497__row59333472188\"><th align=\"left\" class=\"cellrowborder\" id=\"mcps1.3.5.3.1.2.2.1.1.5.1.1\" valign=\"top\" width=\"25%\"><p id=\"ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001919950497__p793317470180\">参数</p> </th> <th align=\"left\" class=\"cellrowborder\" id=\"mcps1.3.5.3.1.2.2.1.1.5.1.2\" valign=\"top\" width=\"25%\"><p id=\"ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001919950497__p2933447121812\">类型</p> </th> <th align=\"left\" class=\"cellrowborder\" id=\"mcps1.3.5.3.1.2.2.1.1.5.1.3\" valign=\"top\" width=\"9.33%\"><p id=\"ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001919950497__p1493313476184\">必填</p> </th> <th align=\"left\" class=\"cellrowborder\" id=\"mcps1.3.5.3.1.2.2.1.1.5.1.4\" valign=\"top\" width=\"40.67%\"><p id=\"ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001919950497__p1393312470188\">说明</p> </th> </tr> </thead> <tbody><tr id=\"ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001919950497__row20933947121819\"><td class=\"cellrowborder\" valign=\"top\" width=\"25%\"><p id=\"ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001919950497__p1832610832011\">onSuccess</p> </td> <td class=\"cellrowborder\" valign=\"top\" width=\"25%\"><p id=\"ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001919950497__p13261383201\">Function</p> </td> <td class=\"cellrowborder\" valign=\"top\" width=\"9.33%\"><p id=\"ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001919950497__p6326108112018\">是</p> </td> <td class=\"cellrowborder\" valign=\"top\" width=\"40.67%\"><p id=\"ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001919950497__p12326148182012\">接口调用成功的回调函数。</p> </td> </tr> <tr id=\"ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001919950497__row149331647181810\"><td class=\"cellrowborder\" valign=\"top\" width=\"25%\"><p id=\"ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001919950497__p113261481205\">onFailure</p> </td> <td class=\"cellrowborder\" valign=\"top\" width=\"25%\"><p id=\"ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001919950497__p1232778142020\">Function</p> </td> <td class=\"cellrowborder\" valign=\"top\" width=\"9.33%\"><p id=\"ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001919950497__p143276852016\">是</p> </td> <td class=\"cellrowborder\" valign=\"top\" width=\"40.67%\"><p id=\"ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001919950497__p73271684207\">接口调用失败的回调函数。</p> </td> </tr> <tr id=\"ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001919950497__row18559943172517\"><td class=\"cellrowborder\" valign=\"top\" width=\"25%\"><p id=\"ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001919950497__p655994352511\">onSendResult</p> </td> <td class=\"cellrowborder\" valign=\"top\" width=\"25%\"><p id=\"ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001919950497__p18154172582615\">Function</p> </td> <td class=\"cellrowborder\" valign=\"top\" width=\"9.33%\"><p id=\"ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001919950497__p155601143192514\">否</p> </td> <td class=\"cellrowborder\" valign=\"top\" width=\"40.67%\"><p id=\"ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001919950497__p1656064382518\">消息发送的回调函数。</p> </td> </tr> <tr id=\"ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001919950497__row19326184817250\"><td class=\"cellrowborder\" valign=\"top\" width=\"25%\"><p id=\"ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001919950497__p832694820252\">onSendProgress</p> </td> <td class=\"cellrowborder\" valign=\"top\" width=\"25%\"><p id=\"ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001919950497__p781310265264\">Function</p> </td> <td class=\"cellrowborder\" valign=\"top\" width=\"9.33%\"><p id=\"ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001919950497__p7326144842511\">否</p> </td> <td class=\"cellrowborder\" valign=\"top\" width=\"40.67%\"><p id=\"ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001919950497__p6538630182711\">消息发送的过程中回调函数。</p> </td> </tr>  </tbody></table> </div> </li></ul> </li><li id=\"ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001919950497__li19185122418208\">示例代码（发送消息）<pre class=\"screen\" id=\"ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001919950497__screen13142942131110\">// 创建点对点通信对象\nvar p2pClient = new P2pClient();\nvar peerPkgName = \"com.*.*\";\nvar peerFinger = \"67DFB7FD********\";\n\n// 设置需要通信的手机侧对应的应用包名\np2pClient.setPeerPkgName(peerPkgName);\n\n// 设置手机侧应用指纹信息\np2pClient.setPeerFingerPrint(peerFinger);\n\n// 构造Builder对象\nvar builderClient = new Builder();\nvar messageStr = \"Hello, Wear Engine!\";\nbuilderClient.setDescription(messageStr);\n// 构造Message对象\nvar sendMessage = new Message();\nsendMessage.builder = builderClient;\n// 定义回调函数\nvar sendCallback ={\n  onSuccess: function() {\n    // send任务执行成功时，应用处理相关的逻辑\n  },\n  onFailure: function() {\n    // send任务执行失败时，应用处理相关的逻辑\n  },\n  onSendResult: function(resultCode) {\n    // send任务执行结束后返回的错误码和信息进行处理\n    console.log(resultCode.data + resultCode.code);\n  },\n}\nif(sendMessage != null &amp;&amp; sendCallback != null){\n  p2pClient.send(sendMessage, sendCallback);\n};</pre> </li></ul> </div> <ul id=\"ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001919950497__ul6363155612319\"><li id=\"ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001919950497__li146274581331\">示例代码（发送文件）<pre class=\"screen\" id=\"ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001919950497__screen762755813312\">// 创建点对点通信对象\nvar p2pClient = new P2pClient();\nvar peerPkgName = \"com.*.*\";\nvar peerFinger = \"67DFB7FD********\";\n\n// 设置需要通信的手机侧对应的应用包名\np2pClient.setPeerPkgName(peerPkgName);\n\n// 设置手机侧应用指纹信息\np2pClient.setPeerFingerPrint(peerFinger);\n\n// 发送文件到手机侧对应的应用\n// 构造Builder对象\nvar testFile = {\n  \"name\" : \"internal://app/testPhoto.png\",  // 文件路径，若发送失败且错误码为208，则说明穿戴设备版本过低，提示用户进行版本升级\n  \"mode\" : \"\",  // 文件类型，'text' or 'binary'\n  \"mode2\" : \"\",  // 文件属性，'R', 'W', 'RW'\n};\nvar builderClient = new Builder();\nbuilderClient.setPayload(testFile);\n// 构造Message对象\nvar sendMessage = new Message();\nsendMessage.builder = builderClient;\n// 定义回调函数\nvar sendCallback = {\n  onSuccess: function() {\n    // send任务执行成功时，应用处理相关的逻辑\n  },\n  onFailure: function() {\n    // send任务执行失败时，应用处理相关的逻辑\n  },\n  onSendResult: function(resultCode) {\n    // send任务执行结束后返回的错误码和信息进行处理\n    console.log(resultCode.data + resultCode.code);\n  },\n  onSendProgress: function(count) {\n    // send任务执行返回进度信息\n    console.log(\"Progress\" + count);\n  },\n}\nif(sendMessage != null &amp;&amp; sendCallback != null){\n  p2pClient.send(sendMessage, sendCallback);\n};</pre> </li></ul> <div class=\"section\" id=\"section2682846161612\"><a name=\"section2682846161612\"></a><a name=\"section2682846161612\"></a><h4>P2pClient.registerReceiver(Object)</h4><p id=\"ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001919950497__p167951418152320\">注册接收器，用于接收手机侧发送过来的消息及文件。</p> <p id=\"ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001919950497__p2094426111913\">接收到的文件将存储在应用私有目录\"internal://app/\"下。</p> <ul id=\"ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001919950497__ul579571813238\"><li id=\"ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001919950497__li87950183235\">请求参数 <div class=\"tablenoborder\"><table id=\"ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001919950497__table12795131842313\"><caption><b>表5 </b>请求参数</caption><thead><tr id=\"ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001919950497__row137961618122318\"><th align=\"left\" class=\"cellrowborder\" id=\"mcps1.3.7.4.1.1.2.5.1.1\" valign=\"top\" width=\"25%\"><p id=\"ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001919950497__p6796318202314\">参数</p> </th> <th align=\"left\" class=\"cellrowborder\" id=\"mcps1.3.7.4.1.1.2.5.1.2\" valign=\"top\" width=\"25%\"><p id=\"ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001919950497__p17796118172319\">类型</p> </th> <th align=\"left\" class=\"cellrowborder\" id=\"mcps1.3.7.4.1.1.2.5.1.3\" valign=\"top\" width=\"11.790000000000001%\"><p id=\"ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001919950497__p177965182231\">必填</p> </th> <th align=\"left\" class=\"cellrowborder\" id=\"mcps1.3.7.4.1.1.2.5.1.4\" valign=\"top\" width=\"38.21%\"><p id=\"ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001919950497__p137967182239\">说明</p> </th> </tr> </thead> <tbody><tr id=\"ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001919950497__row18797118192314\"><td class=\"cellrowborder\" valign=\"top\" width=\"25%\"><p id=\"ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001919950497__p12521039103110\"><a href=\"#ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001919950497__table15927111072513\">receiver</a></p> </td> <td class=\"cellrowborder\" valign=\"top\" width=\"25%\"><p id=\"ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001919950497__p13797181820231\">Object</p> </td> <td class=\"cellrowborder\" valign=\"top\" width=\"11.790000000000001%\"><p id=\"ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001919950497__p979716189231\">是</p> </td> <td class=\"cellrowborder\" valign=\"top\" width=\"38.21%\"><p id=\"ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001919950497__p1279791832311\">注册接收消息的回调。</p> </td> </tr>  </tbody></table> </div> <ul id=\"ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001919950497__ul20280143594218\"><li id=\"ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001919950497__li112801635124215\">receiver <div class=\"tablenoborder\"><a name=\"ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001919950497__table15927111072513\"></a><a name=\"table15927111072513\"></a><table id=\"ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001919950497__table15927111072513\"><thead><tr id=\"ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001919950497__row16927131072519\"><th align=\"left\" class=\"cellrowborder\" id=\"mcps1.3.7.4.1.2.1.1.1.4.1.1\" valign=\"top\" width=\"33.33333333333333%\"><p id=\"ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001919950497__p1519511617121\">参数值</p> </th> <th align=\"left\" class=\"cellrowborder\" id=\"mcps1.3.7.4.1.2.1.1.1.4.1.2\" valign=\"top\" width=\"33.33333333333333%\"><p id=\"ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001919950497__p41957619125\">类型</p> </th> <th align=\"left\" class=\"cellrowborder\" id=\"mcps1.3.7.4.1.2.1.1.1.4.1.3\" valign=\"top\" width=\"33.33333333333333%\"><p id=\"ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001919950497__p31951966120\">说明</p> </th> </tr> </thead> <tbody><tr id=\"ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001919950497__row15927151020255\"><td class=\"cellrowborder\" valign=\"top\" width=\"33.33333333333333%\"><p id=\"ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001919950497__p5871155617336\">onSuccess</p> </td> <td class=\"cellrowborder\" valign=\"top\" width=\"33.33333333333333%\"><p id=\"ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001919950497__p139774487252\">Function</p> </td> <td class=\"cellrowborder\" valign=\"top\" width=\"33.33333333333333%\"><p id=\"ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001919950497__p01941155162511\">注册成功的回调函数。</p> </td> </tr> <tr id=\"ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001919950497__row138691331349\"><td class=\"cellrowborder\" valign=\"top\" width=\"33.33333333333333%\"><p id=\"ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001919950497__p8169114293417\">onFailure</p> </td> <td class=\"cellrowborder\" valign=\"top\" width=\"33.33333333333333%\"><p id=\"ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001919950497__p1886914337346\">Function</p> </td> <td class=\"cellrowborder\" valign=\"top\" width=\"33.33333333333333%\"><p id=\"ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001919950497__p10869233133415\">注册失败的回调函数。</p> </td> </tr> <tr id=\"ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001919950497__row1269123118344\"><td class=\"cellrowborder\" valign=\"top\" width=\"33.33333333333333%\"><p id=\"ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001919950497__p52411747163413\"><a href=\"#ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001919950497__li1589210463420\">onReceiveMessage</a></p> </td> <td class=\"cellrowborder\" valign=\"top\" width=\"33.33333333333333%\"><p id=\"ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001919950497__p15705310345\">Function</p> </td> <td class=\"cellrowborder\" valign=\"top\" width=\"33.33333333333333%\"><p id=\"ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001919950497__p1701831143416\">注册消息返回的回调函数。</p> </td> </tr>  </tbody></table> </div> <ul id=\"ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001919950497__ul379195784214\"><li id=\"ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001919950497__li1589210463420\"><a name=\"ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001919950497__li1589210463420\"></a><a name=\"li1589210463420\"></a>onReceiveMessage返回值（消息） <div class=\"tablenoborder\"><table id=\"ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001919950497__table19247115618262\"><thead><tr id=\"ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001919950497__row182481856192611\"><th align=\"left\" class=\"cellrowborder\" id=\"mcps1.3.7.4.1.2.1.2.1.1.1.5.1.1\" valign=\"top\" width=\"25%\"><p id=\"ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001919950497__p1624835610263\">参数</p> </th> <th align=\"left\" class=\"cellrowborder\" id=\"mcps1.3.7.4.1.2.1.2.1.1.1.5.1.2\" valign=\"top\" width=\"25%\"><p id=\"ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001919950497__p924885692612\">类型</p> </th> <th align=\"left\" class=\"cellrowborder\" id=\"mcps1.3.7.4.1.2.1.2.1.1.1.5.1.3\" valign=\"top\" width=\"9.33%\"><p id=\"ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001919950497__p122482569262\">必填</p> </th> <th align=\"left\" class=\"cellrowborder\" id=\"mcps1.3.7.4.1.2.1.2.1.1.1.5.1.4\" valign=\"top\" width=\"40.67%\"><p id=\"ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001919950497__p1524819567269\">说明</p> </th> </tr> </thead> <tbody><tr id=\"ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001919950497__row22481456152620\"><td class=\"cellrowborder\" valign=\"top\" width=\"25%\"><p id=\"ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001919950497__p202481156122619\">data</p> </td> <td class=\"cellrowborder\" valign=\"top\" width=\"25%\"><p id=\"ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001919950497__p9248456172614\">string</p> </td> <td class=\"cellrowborder\" valign=\"top\" width=\"9.33%\"><p id=\"ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001919950497__p124835610260\">是</p> </td> <td class=\"cellrowborder\" valign=\"top\" width=\"40.67%\"><p id=\"ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001919950497__p72487566268\">手机侧发送回来消息的具体内容。</p> </td> </tr>  </tbody></table> </div> </li><li id=\"ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001919950497__li6549452154219\">onReceiveMessage返回值（文件） <div class=\"tablenoborder\"><table id=\"ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001919950497__table493693414213\"><thead><tr id=\"ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001919950497__row593611343424\"><th align=\"left\" class=\"cellrowborder\" id=\"mcps1.3.7.4.1.2.1.2.2.1.1.5.1.1\" valign=\"top\" width=\"25%\"><p id=\"ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001919950497__p17936193414423\">参数</p> </th> <th align=\"left\" class=\"cellrowborder\" id=\"mcps1.3.7.4.1.2.1.2.2.1.1.5.1.2\" valign=\"top\" width=\"25%\"><p id=\"ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001919950497__p4937183424215\">类型</p> </th> <th align=\"left\" class=\"cellrowborder\" id=\"mcps1.3.7.4.1.2.1.2.2.1.1.5.1.3\" valign=\"top\" width=\"9.33%\"><p id=\"ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001919950497__p19379344423\">必填</p> </th> <th align=\"left\" class=\"cellrowborder\" id=\"mcps1.3.7.4.1.2.1.2.2.1.1.5.1.4\" valign=\"top\" width=\"40.67%\"><p id=\"ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001919950497__p49372345429\">说明</p> </th> </tr> </thead> <tbody><tr id=\"ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001919950497__row17937173444211\"><td class=\"cellrowborder\" valign=\"top\" width=\"25%\"><p id=\"ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001919950497__p59376347426\"><a href=\"#ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001919950497__table0623113284316\">data</a></p> </td> <td class=\"cellrowborder\" valign=\"top\" width=\"25%\"><p id=\"ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001919950497__p593753414420\">Object</p> </td> <td class=\"cellrowborder\" valign=\"top\" width=\"9.33%\"><p id=\"ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001919950497__p19937634134217\">是</p> </td> <td class=\"cellrowborder\" valign=\"top\" width=\"40.67%\"><p id=\"ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001919950497__p18937113464212\">手机侧发送回来文件信息。</p> </td> </tr>  </tbody></table> </div> <ul id=\"ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001919950497__ul713736174318\"><li id=\"ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001919950497__li16358630164311\">data（文件） <div class=\"tablenoborder\"><a name=\"ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001919950497__table0623113284316\"></a><a name=\"table0623113284316\"></a><table id=\"ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001919950497__table0623113284316\"><thead><tr id=\"ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001919950497__row3623173284313\"><th align=\"left\" class=\"cellrowborder\" id=\"mcps1.3.7.4.1.2.1.2.2.2.1.1.1.5.1.1\" valign=\"top\" width=\"25%\"><p id=\"ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001919950497__p26235320436\">参数</p> </th> <th align=\"left\" class=\"cellrowborder\" id=\"mcps1.3.7.4.1.2.1.2.2.2.1.1.1.5.1.2\" valign=\"top\" width=\"25%\"><p id=\"ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001919950497__p56231632154317\">类型</p> </th> <th align=\"left\" class=\"cellrowborder\" id=\"mcps1.3.7.4.1.2.1.2.2.2.1.1.1.5.1.3\" valign=\"top\" width=\"9.33%\"><p id=\"ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001919950497__p662314324435\">必填</p> </th> <th align=\"left\" class=\"cellrowborder\" id=\"mcps1.3.7.4.1.2.1.2.2.2.1.1.1.5.1.4\" valign=\"top\" width=\"40.67%\"><p id=\"ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001919950497__p86234322439\">说明</p> </th> </tr> </thead> <tbody><tr id=\"ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001919950497__row1362393218438\"><td class=\"cellrowborder\" valign=\"top\" width=\"25%\"><p id=\"ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001919950497__p1962316327430\">isFileType</p> </td> <td class=\"cellrowborder\" valign=\"top\" width=\"25%\"><p id=\"ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001919950497__p96237326437\">boolean</p> </td> <td class=\"cellrowborder\" valign=\"top\" width=\"9.33%\"><p id=\"ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001919950497__p12623232174318\">是</p> </td> <td class=\"cellrowborder\" valign=\"top\" width=\"40.67%\"><p id=\"ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001919950497__p15623193204312\">接收到的消息是否是文件类型。</p> </td> </tr> <tr id=\"ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001919950497__row12336581451\"><td class=\"cellrowborder\" valign=\"top\" width=\"25%\"><p id=\"ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001919950497__p3337485458\">name</p> </td> <td class=\"cellrowborder\" valign=\"top\" width=\"25%\"><p id=\"ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001919950497__p103374816453\">string</p> </td> <td class=\"cellrowborder\" valign=\"top\" width=\"9.33%\"><p id=\"ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001919950497__p16337128184511\">是</p> </td> <td class=\"cellrowborder\" valign=\"top\" width=\"40.67%\"><p id=\"ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001919950497__p83371483451\">接收到的文件地址及名称，格式如：internal://app/文件名 或app/ace/data/应用包名/文件名</p> </td> </tr>  </tbody></table> </div> </li></ul> </li></ul> </li></ul> </li><li id=\"ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001919950497__li1079810188238\">示例代码<pre class=\"screen\" id=\"ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001919950497__screen2186143164610\">// 创建点对点通信对象\nvar p2pClient = new P2pClient();\nvar peerPkgName = \"com.*.*\";\nvar peerFinger = \"67DFB7FD********\";\n\n// 设置需要通信的手机侧对应的应用包名\np2pClient.setPeerPkgName(peerPkgName);\n\n// 设置手机侧应用指纹信息\np2pClient.setPeerFingerPrint(peerFinger);\n\n// 接收手机侧应用发过来的简短消息或文件\n// 定义接收器\nvar flash = this;\nvar receiver = {\n  onSuccess: function() {\n    // 处理注册接收手机侧简短消息或文件成功的回调函数 \n    flash.receiveMessageOK = \"接受消息成功\";\n  },\n  onFailure :function() {\n    // 处理注册接收手机侧简短消息或文件失败的回调函数 \n    flash.receiveMessageOK = \"接受消息失败\";\n  },\n  onReceiveMessage: function (data) {\n    if (data &amp;&amp; data.isFileType) {\n      // 处理手机侧应用发过来的文件\n      flash.receiveMessageOK = \"文件:\" + data.name;\n    } else {\n      // 处理手机侧应用发过来的简短消息\n      flash.receiveMessageOK = \"消息:\" + data;\n    }\n  },\n}\np2pClient.registerReceiver(receiver);</pre> </li></ul> </div> <div class=\"section\" id=\"section1672614593166\"><a name=\"section1672614593166\"></a><a name=\"section1672614593166\"></a><h4>P2pClient.unregisterReceiver(Object)</h4><p id=\"ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001919950497__p176462018152718\">取消注册接收手机侧发送过来的消息或文件，建议在应用的onDestroy生命周期里或之前调用本方法，以释放服务端资源。</p> <ul id=\"ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001919950497__ul5646161815278\"><li id=\"ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001919950497__li2064661812719\">请求参数 <div class=\"tablenoborder\"><table id=\"ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001919950497__table13959351474\"><caption><b>表6 </b>请求参数</caption><thead><tr id=\"ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001919950497__row39601751072\"><th align=\"left\" class=\"cellrowborder\" id=\"mcps1.3.8.3.1.1.2.5.1.1\" valign=\"top\" width=\"25%\"><p id=\"ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001919950497__p096016518718\">参数</p> </th> <th align=\"left\" class=\"cellrowborder\" id=\"mcps1.3.8.3.1.1.2.5.1.2\" valign=\"top\" width=\"25%\"><p id=\"ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001919950497__p19602511376\">类型</p> </th> <th align=\"left\" class=\"cellrowborder\" id=\"mcps1.3.8.3.1.1.2.5.1.3\" valign=\"top\" width=\"11.790000000000001%\"><p id=\"ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001919950497__p129601351673\">必填</p> </th> <th align=\"left\" class=\"cellrowborder\" id=\"mcps1.3.8.3.1.1.2.5.1.4\" valign=\"top\" width=\"38.21%\"><p id=\"ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001919950497__p59609511771\">说明</p> </th> </tr> </thead> <tbody><tr id=\"ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001919950497__row796013512711\"><td class=\"cellrowborder\" valign=\"top\" width=\"25%\"><p id=\"ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001919950497__p29604517719\"><a href=\"#ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001919950497__table131258920819\">receiver</a></p> </td> <td class=\"cellrowborder\" valign=\"top\" width=\"25%\"><p id=\"ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001919950497__p19960105119718\">Object</p> </td> <td class=\"cellrowborder\" valign=\"top\" width=\"11.790000000000001%\"><p id=\"ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001919950497__p1196017514713\">是</p> </td> <td class=\"cellrowborder\" valign=\"top\" width=\"38.21%\"><p id=\"ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001919950497__p096017511074\">停止接收消息的回调。</p> </td> </tr>  </tbody></table> </div> <ul id=\"ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001919950497__ul989814344315\"><li id=\"ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001919950497__li38981043154312\">receiver <div class=\"tablenoborder\"><a name=\"ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001919950497__table131258920819\"></a><a name=\"table131258920819\"></a><table id=\"ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001919950497__table131258920819\"><thead><tr id=\"ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001919950497__row1612529086\"><th align=\"left\" class=\"cellrowborder\" id=\"mcps1.3.8.3.1.2.1.1.1.5.1.1\" valign=\"top\" width=\"25%\"><p id=\"ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001919950497__p2012619913812\">参数</p> </th> <th align=\"left\" class=\"cellrowborder\" id=\"mcps1.3.8.3.1.2.1.1.1.5.1.2\" valign=\"top\" width=\"25%\"><p id=\"ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001919950497__p71261792082\">类型</p> </th> <th align=\"left\" class=\"cellrowborder\" id=\"mcps1.3.8.3.1.2.1.1.1.5.1.3\" valign=\"top\" width=\"11.790000000000001%\"><p id=\"ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001919950497__p1126169988\">必填</p> </th> <th align=\"left\" class=\"cellrowborder\" id=\"mcps1.3.8.3.1.2.1.1.1.5.1.4\" valign=\"top\" width=\"38.21%\"><p id=\"ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001919950497__p141261399817\">说明</p> </th> </tr> </thead> <tbody><tr id=\"ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001919950497__row14126129788\"><td class=\"cellrowborder\" valign=\"top\" width=\"25%\"><p id=\"ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001919950497__p154838431189\">onSuccess</p> </td> <td class=\"cellrowborder\" valign=\"top\" width=\"25%\"><p id=\"ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001919950497__p181261695818\">Function</p> </td> <td class=\"cellrowborder\" valign=\"top\" width=\"11.790000000000001%\"><p id=\"ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001919950497__p412699582\">是</p> </td> <td class=\"cellrowborder\" valign=\"top\" width=\"38.21%\"><p id=\"ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001919950497__p1112613912818\">停止接收消息成功的回调函数。</p> </td> </tr> <tr id=\"ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001919950497__row4701112316122\"><td class=\"cellrowborder\" valign=\"top\" width=\"25%\"><p id=\"ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001919950497__p370132351213\">onFail</p> </td> <td class=\"cellrowborder\" valign=\"top\" width=\"25%\"><p id=\"ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001919950497__p17021623101216\">Function</p> </td> <td class=\"cellrowborder\" valign=\"top\" width=\"11.790000000000001%\"><p id=\"ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001919950497__p1870262314121\">是</p> </td> <td class=\"cellrowborder\" valign=\"top\" width=\"38.21%\"><p id=\"ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001919950497__p114150281315\">停止接收消息失败的回调函数（轻量级智能穿戴设备不支持）。</p> </td> </tr>  </tbody></table> </div> </li></ul> </li><li id=\"ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001919950497__li1765119187273\">示例代码<pre class=\"screen\" id=\"ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001919950497__screen21042616710\">// 创建点对点通信对象\nvar p2pClient = new P2pClient();\np2pClient.unregisterReceiver({\n  onSuccess:<span style=\"color: rgb(0,0,255);\">function</span>() {\n    console.log(<span style=\"color: rgb(163,21,21);\">\"停止接收消息发送成功\"</span>);\n  },\n);</pre> </li></ul> </div> </div> <div></div></body></html>","metadata":{}},"catalogName":"connectivity-References","isImport":2,"tag":"10102004","fileName":"point-to-point-message-0000001052164296","navigationAddress":"/hmos/hms/smart-device","updatedDate":"2024-07-02 08:55:18","serviceBreadUrl":"https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/hms/huawei-wearengine","websiteType":"1","isGray":0,"restrictedType":0,"subTitle":"Smart Device","domainBreadName":"","searchTitle":"","keywords":"","intelligentRecommendFlag":false,"versionLabels":["hmos"],"contentLabels":["celin-hmos","hms-core","notuse"]}}